#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:4
msgid "Tutorial: experiment matrices from the CLI"
msgstr "教程：用 CLI 跑实验矩阵"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:6
msgid ""
"Writing one Python script per experiment does not scale. fl-sim's command"
" line interface runs a whole **experiment matrix** from a single YAML "
"file: you describe the grid of configurations once, and the CLI expands "
"and executes every combination. This tutorial builds a four-run matrix on"
" synthetic data and shows where the results land."
msgstr ""
"每个实验写一个 Python 脚本是无法扩展的。fl-sim 的命令行接口能用单个 YAML 文件跑起一整个 **实验矩阵** "
"：你把配置网格描述一次，CLI 负责展开并执行每个组合。本教程在合成数据上构建一个四次运行的矩阵，并展示结果落在哪里。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:12
msgid ""
"The YAML syntax reference lives in :doc:`cli`; this page is the workflow "
"narrative. Prerequisites: :doc:`tutorial-first-experiment`."
msgstr "YAML 语法参考见 :doc:`cli` ；本页讲的是工作流程。前置阅读：:doc:`tutorial-first-experiment` 。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:16
msgid "The matrix file"
msgstr "矩阵文件"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:18
msgid ""
"Here is the complete config for this tutorial (``example-configs"
"/fedsynthetic-demo.yml``):"
msgstr "本教程的完整配置如下（``example-configs/fedsynthetic-demo.yml`` ）："

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:24
msgid "Three sections matter:"
msgstr "三个关键部分："

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:26
msgid ""
"``strategy.matrix`` — the grid. Every combination of the listed values is"
" run once: 2 sampling ratios × 2 seeds = 4 experiments."
msgstr "``strategy.matrix``——网格。列出的值每个组合各跑一次：2 个采样比例 × 2 个种子= 4 个实验。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:28
msgid ""
"``${{ matrix.<key> }}`` — interpolation. Wherever this pattern appears, "
"the CLI substitutes the current combination's value. ``seed`` sits at the"
" top level, so it seeds the dataset *and* the server config of that run."
msgstr ""
"``${{ matrix.<key> }}``——插值。该模式出现之处，CLI 都会代入当前组合的值。``seed`` "
"位于顶层，因此它同时为该次运行的数据集 *和* 服务器配置设定种子。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:32
msgid ""
"everything else — ``algorithm`` (name plus server/client configs), "
"``dataset``, ``model`` — is exactly the config you would pass in Python, "
"per :doc:`quickstart`, just spelled as YAML. Dataset-specific constructor"
" arguments (``alpha``, ``beta``, ``iid``, ``num_clients`` for "
":class:`~fl_sim.data_processing.fed_synthetic.FedSynthetic`) are passed "
"straight through."
msgstr ""
"其余部分—— ``algorithm`` （名字加服务器/客户端配置）、 ``dataset`` 、 ``model`` ——与你在 Python"
" 里传入的配置（见 :doc:`quickstart` ）完全一致，只是改写成 YAML。数据集各自的构造参数（ "
":class:`~fl_sim.data_processing.fed_synthetic.FedSynthetic` 的 ``alpha`` 、"
" ``beta`` 、 ``iid`` 、 ``num_clients`` ）原样透传。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:40
msgid "Run it"
msgstr "运行"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:46
msgid ""
"You will see the four runs execute in sequence, each logging its "
"combination (``ratio=0.5 seed=0``, ...). Total time: seconds — no "
"downloads."
msgstr "你会看到四次运行依次执行，每次都会记录自己的组合（``ratio=0.5 seed=0`` 等）。总耗时：几秒——无下载。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:51
msgid "Where the results land"
msgstr "结果落在哪里"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:53
msgid ""
"All runs write into ``~/.cache/fl-sim/.logs/fedsynthetic-demo/`` (the "
"``log_dir`` of this config). Per run you get one ``.txt`` and one "
"``.json`` log — the same files :doc:`quickstart` described — plus one "
"``config.json`` holding the exact server/client configs of the most "
"recent run (a previous ``config.json`` is rotated to "
"``config.json.bak``)."
msgstr ""
"所有运行都写入 ``~/.cache/fl-sim/.logs/fedsynthetic-demo/``（本配置的 ``log_dir`` "
"）。每次运行各有一份 ``.txt`` 与一份 ``.json`` 日志——即 :doc:`quickstart` 描述过的那些文件——另有一份 "
"``config.json`` 保存最近一次运行的确切服务器/客户端配置（已有的 ``config.json`` 会被轮转为 "
"``config.json.bak`` ）。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:60
msgid ""
"One detail that matters as soon as runs finish within the same minute: "
"log file names carry a timestamp **plus the run's ``tag``**. Without a "
"distinct tag per matrix combination, same-named logs overwrite each "
"other. That is what the ``tag: ratio_${{ ... }}_seed_${{ ... }}`` line in"
" the config above is for — give every matrix arm its own tag."
msgstr ""
"一个在多次运行同一分钟内结束时就会生效的细节：日志文件名带有时间戳 **加上运行的 ``tag``** 。若每个矩阵组合没有独特的 "
"tag，同名的日志会互相覆盖。上面配置里的 ``tag: ratio_${{ ... }}_seed_${{ ... }}`` "
"正是为此——给矩阵的每个分支一个专属 tag。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:67
msgid "Beyond serial execution"
msgstr "超越串行执行"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:69
msgid ""
"A matrix of long experiments wants more than one process. The "
"``strategy`` section also accepts parallel options (``n_parallel``, or a "
"``parallel: {mode: parallel_task, num_workers: N}`` block) that dispatch "
"matrix arms to worker processes — see ``example-configs/multiprocessing-"
"demo.yml`` for a complete example, and :doc:`parallel_execution` for the "
"in-process executor backend that parallelizes *within* a single run. The "
"two are orthogonal: process-level parallelism across matrix arms, "
"executor-level parallelism across clients."
msgstr ""
"长实验组成的矩阵需要不止一个进程。 ``strategy`` 节还接受并行选项（``n_parallel``，或 ``parallel: "
"{mode: parallel_task, num_workers: N}`` 块），把矩阵分支派发给工作进程——完整示例见 ``example-"
"configs/multiprocessing-demo.yml``；进程内把 *单次运行* 的客户端并行化的执行器后端见 "
":doc:`parallel_execution` 。两者正交：进程级并行作用于矩阵分支之间，执行器级并行作用于客户端之间。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:79
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr "下一步"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:81
msgid ":doc:`cli` — the full YAML syntax reference and CLI options."
msgstr ":doc:`cli`——完整的 YAML 语法参考与 CLI 选项。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:82
msgid ":doc:`parallel_execution` — speed up each individual run."
msgstr ":doc:`parallel_execution`——加速每一次单独的运行。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-cli-matrix.rst:83
msgid ""
":ref:`howto-custom-algorithm`, :ref:`howto-custom-dataset` and :ref"
":`howto-custom-optimizer` — extend the framework itself; the ``test-"
"files/custom_*.py`` files they walk through are complete, runnable "
"examples that the CLI accepts as algorithm/dataset paths."
msgstr ""
":ref:`howto-custom-algorithm` 、 :ref:`howto-custom-dataset` 与 :ref:`howto-custom-optimizer` ——扩展框架本身；它们讲解的 ``test-files/custom_*.py`` 就是完整可运行的例子，CLI 可直接接受为算法/数据集路径。"

